// The Boyle party guard (`DishonoredSpawner_46`, yaw 251.4) sees the player standing 600 uu in
// front of it. Original, per-tick trace (ORACLE.md "Capture requests answered", 2026-10-08): the
// first sighting is through the OUTER cone (LOS norm 0.353 = 600 / 1700, 0.339 / s), level 1 at
// frame 45; once the head turns toward the player the inner cone applies (norm 0.169 = 591 / 3500,
// 0.79 / s), level 4 at frame 111. So the vision axis is the head (`camera_jnt`), not the body,
// and HeadTrack turns the head (stealth.md F4 / F5): U-864's 0.164 was taken with the head
// already turned. The port's head (stealth.md section 13): eye at the baked `camera_jnt`, axis the
// pawn's rotation while no look-at request runs (look-at enabled), the HeadTrack cursor after. It
// sees the player in the inner cone from the first tick (0.171); an outer first sighting needs the
// look-at disabled by an ambient idle (bone axis) or another vision-target point (F6): capture queued.
(
    name: "stealth/detect_600",
    system: Stealth,
    map: "L_Boyle_Ext_P",
    description: "Stand 600 uu in front of the party guard: outer-cone sighting first, inner cone once the head turns.",
    setup: (
        player: Some((position: (-3201.5, -2763.3, 20), yaw: 71.37, snap_to_floor: true)),
        npcs: [(id: Some("guard"), spawner: Some("DishonoredSpawner_46"), yaw: 251.37, state: Some("Idle"))],
        settle: 1,
    ),
    ticks: 130,
    input: [],
    checkpoints: [
        (name: "first LOS norm (outer cone)", expect: [(metric: At("npc.guard.los", 10), value: 0.353, tol: 0.01, source: "ORACLE.md 2026-10-08 detect_600: 600 / 1700 at first", status: Measured)]),
        (name: "first rate", expect: [(metric: Delta("npc.guard.attn", 5, 35), value: 0.1695, tol: 0.03, source: "ORACLE.md 2026-10-08: 0.339 / s before the head turns", status: Measured)]),
        (name: "notices", expect: [(metric: TimeToReach("npc.guard.attn_level", 1), value: 0.75, tol: 0.05, source: "ORACLE.md 2026-10-08: level 1 at frame 45", status: Measured)]),
        (name: "busted", expect: [(metric: TimeToReach("npc.guard.attn_level", 4), value: 1.85, tol: 0.1, source: "ORACLE.md 2026-10-08: level 4 at frame 111", status: Measured)]),
        (name: "LOS norm after the head turns (inner cone)", expect: [(metric: At("npc.guard.los", 100), value: 0.169, tol: 0.01, source: "ORACLE.md 2026-10-08: 591 / 3500 once the head turned (the turn tick is not given)", status: Unverified)]),
    ],
    record: [Pawn, Npc("guard"), Bones("guard", ["+world"]), AnimState("guard")],
    capture: Some("captured 2026-10-08 (session run with npc attention channels); the camera_jnt pose per tick is still requested (capture_queue.txt)"),
)
